{"unit":2,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 2","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 2 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Street life</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx253\">Thirty questions on Unit 2 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u2\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u2r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r102\">Usually or right now? Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Look! Someone &hellip; the guitar on the corner.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is playing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">plays</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The market &hellip; at six every morning.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is opening</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">opens</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I &hellip; my sister&rsquo;s flat this month.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am using</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">use</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Street cleaners &hellip; here twice a day.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are coming</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">come</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>rain</i>) It usually <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"rains\" data-why=\"<i>Usually</i> &rarr; Present Simple: <b>rains</b>.\"> a lot in April.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>stand</i>) Be careful &mdash; you <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"are standing|'re standing\" data-why=\"Happening at this moment: <b>are standing</b>.\"> in the cycle lane.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>know</i>) I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"know\" data-why=\"<b>Know</b> is a state verb &mdash; no continuous form, even for now.\"> this street very well.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r104\">Choose the correct relative word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">That&rsquo;s the shop &hellip; sells souvenirs.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">who</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">which</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">where</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">He&rsquo;s the man &hellip; cleans our street.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">who</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">which</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">where</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">This is the square &hellip; the market is.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">which</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">where</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"The Present Continuous needs <i>-ing</i>: <i>She is <b>working</b> at the market today</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">She</span> <span class=\"ew\">is</span> <span class=\"ew\">work</span> <span class=\"ew\">at</span> <span class=\"ew\">the</span> <span class=\"ew\">market</span> <span class=\"ew\">today</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"For a person we use <b>who</b>, not <i>which</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">That&rsquo;s</span> <span class=\"ew\">the</span> <span class=\"ew\">woman</span> <span class=\"ew\">which</span> <span class=\"ew\">sells</span> <span class=\"ew\">flowers</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r106\">Join the two sentences into one.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">The man lives next door. He is an architect.<br>The man <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"who lives next door|that lives next door\" data-why=\"A person &rarr; <b>who lives next door</b>.\"> is an architect.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">There is a shop on the corner. It sells only bread.<br>It&rsquo;s a shop <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"which sells only bread|that sells only bread|which sells only bread.|that sells only bread.\" data-why=\"A thing &rarr; <b>which sells only bread</b>.\"></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u2r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r108\">Complete each sentence with one word or phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">There is nowhere to leave the car &mdash; there isn&rsquo;t a single <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"parking space\" data-why=\"A <b>parking space</b> is an area big enough for one car.\"> in this street.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">They live on the fourteenth floor of a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"tower block\" data-why=\"A <b>tower block</b> is a very tall building of flats or offices.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Please put your <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"rubbish\" data-why=\"<b>Rubbish</b> = the things you throw away.\"> in the bin.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">The bathroom <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"tap\" data-why=\"A <b>tap</b> is the part you turn to make water come out.\"> is dripping again.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">There is no cooker in the flat, only a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"microwave oven|microwave\" data-why=\"A <b>microwave oven</b> heats food very quickly.\">.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">The streets are full of people and you can hardly move. It is very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">narrow</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">crowded</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">lively</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Nothing ever happens here. The town is completely &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">lively</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dull</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">crowded</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">You hang your clothes in a &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">wardrobe</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">chest of drawers</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wash basin</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others belong on a bed or in a bathroom. A <b>statue</b> stands in the street.\"><span class=\"ew\">sheet</span> <span class=\"ew\">duvet</span> <span class=\"ew\">towel</span> <span class=\"ew\">statue</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others belong to a market. A <b>crossroads</b> is a place where roads meet.\"><span class=\"ew\">stall</span> <span class=\"ew\">market place</span> <span class=\"ew\">shopper</span> <span class=\"ew\">crossroads</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u2r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">Could you tell me &hellip; to the station?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the way</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a way</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">way</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">Go &hellip; until you reach the roundabout.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">straight on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">straight at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">direct</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">The pharmacy is on the other side of the road. The library is &hellip; it.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">opposite</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">on the corner of</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">past</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">Take the second <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"turning\" data-why=\"<b>Take the second turning</b> = leave the road at the second road going off it.\"> on the left.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">It&rsquo;s the green door. You can&rsquo;t <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"miss\" data-why=\"<b>You can&rsquo;t miss it</b> = it is very easy to find.\"> it.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u2r114\">Put the three instructions in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">It&rsquo;s on the corner, opposite the bank.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Come out of the station and turn right.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Go past the supermarket and cross the road.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}